    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get the blood test thing but i really dont have the time to wait for an appointment and everything right now. i just want to start optimizing my levels today and feel better. if i take the 100mg for like a couple of weeks and then scale it back once i feel my energy coming back, wouldn't that be fine? just looking for a bit of an aggressive start to get over the hump.",
