    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you about the doctor but i've read online that people use much higher doses for \"loading phases\" to fix deficiencies fast. like, i saw some biohacking forums suggesting 200mg or even 300mg for a short bursts to really jumpstart the body. if i'm just doing it for a week or so, is there really a high risk of overload? i'm a pretty healthy person, i just need this energy boost for a big project i'm working on.",
